HST Office: the Vietnamese stock "_Yes" button of framework read "Đồng ý (_Y)", the last
'(X)'-suffix access key left in the stock buttons and a "Yes" rendering the glossary rejects.
It now reads "_Có" like the stock buttons of every other module. The line is context of
hst-document-tabs.patch, so it is changed here and not through l10n/vi-overrides.jsonl.

--- a/translations/source/vi/framework/messages.po
+++ b/translations/source/vi/framework/messages.po
@@ -442,7 +442,7 @@
 #. mgpxh
 msgctxt "stock"
 msgid "_Yes"
-msgstr "Đồng ý (_Y)"
+msgstr "_Có"
 
 #. hstDT
 #: framework/inc/strings.hrc
